      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the late 1960s, Slate Run Elementary pioneered student‑produced closed‑circuit television, becoming one of the first schools in the country to offer such a program.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
